    "steam_appid": 1533580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533580/extras/1a6b4116a6f57413bec2f30c77dae929.avif?t=1704239313\" /></div><br><br><strong>Dots n Lines (Dots and Boxes)</strong> is a classic game and old-school game brought to you by Tuga Studios.<br><br>The game starts with an empty grid of dots. Usually, two players take turns adding a single horizontal or vertical line between two unjoined adjacent dots.<br><br>A player who completes the fourth side of a 1\u00d71 box earns one point and takes another turn. (A point is typically recorded by placing a mark that identifies the player in the box, such as an initial.)<br><br>The game ends when no more lines can be placed. The winner is the player with the most points.<br><br>Features:<br>- Single Player Mode (Against Computer)<br>- Two-Player Mode<br>- Different grids (5x5, 6x6, etc.)<br>- Very fun to play with your friend.<br>- Nice graphics and sounds.<br><br>Enjoy it!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533580/extras/1a6b4116a6f57413bec2f30c77dae929.avif?t=1704239313\" /></div><br><br><strong>Dots n Lines (Dots and Boxes)</strong> is a classic game and old-school game brought to you by Tuga Studios.<br><br>The game starts with an empty grid of dots. Usually, two players take turns adding a single horizontal or vertical line between two unjoined adjacent dots.<br><br>A player who completes the fourth side of a 1\u00d71 box earns one point and takes another turn. (A point is typically recorded by placing a mark that identifies the player in the box, such as an initial.)<br><br>The game ends when no more lines can be placed. The winner is the player with the most points.<br><br>Features:<br>- Single Player Mode (Against Computer)<br>- Two-Player Mode<br>- Different grids (5x5, 6x6, etc.)<br>- Very fun to play with your friend.<br>- Nice graphics and sounds.<br><br>Enjoy it!",
    "short_description": "Dots n Lines (Dots and Boxes) game is a classic and old school game brought you by Tuga Studios.",
